<title>USA: Sioux City cattle no test - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle no test - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said there were not enough cattle for a market test.</p>
<p>Steers - few select and choice 1279-1328 lbs 64.25-65.85. Few select, with few choice 1330 lbs 63.10.</p>
<p>Heifers - few choice 1358 lbs 65.50. Few select and choice 1104 lbs 64.35.</p>
